// Article 3. Missed time.
#require "2-holidays.charter".
Duty make-up-due Holder parent Claimant other
  Due within 60
  Terminated by give-make-up-time
Act give-make-up-time Actor parent Recipient other
Extend Act hand-over
  Creates make-up-due(parent, other) When Violated(regular-week(parent, other)) || Violated(holiday-time(parent, other))

Clause 3.1 Approved "5654f1dadf4659ea5ec78ef3d2ed9bff8b51ea1cb43745dce1d16fddeba72b45"
  Norm "A parent who keeps Mia more than a day into the other parent's time owes the other parent make-up time." => hand-over, make-up-due
  Norm " The make-up time is given within sixty days." => make-up-due, give-make-up-time
.
